diagnostics_after_measurement.D3_dispute_harness:
A new read-only headline-and-state harness (a path dependency, built in target-d2) that counts, per seed and country:
- orders by scope;
- compliances by resolution (Complied, NegotiatedCompliance, CompliedWhileOpen);
- refusals, negotiations, withdrawals, enforcements (explicit and by default) and lapses by resolution;
- escalations, with first dates and repeats after an escalation;
- AI-issued refusals (must be 0 under Prudent; nonzero is an implementation bug);
- saved powers at the end;
- national leverage at the start, minimum and end, and the number of compliance-driven reductions.
